To add, create, save, record, organise, or manage a task, to-do, action item, or something that needs to be done, you must always use this:
{"tool":"add_task","text":"..."}


To save, add, store, create, or record someone's contact, name, email address, phone number, or contact details, you must always use this:
{"tool":"save_contact","name":"...","email":"...","phone":"..."}


To convert, exchange, calculate, or change money from one currency to another, or find the value of an amount in another currency, you must always use this:
